# Milestone: M5
# Covers: at (obj.x.changed?) subscriber fires on slot mutation; basic
#         slot-change event: single subscriber, single write, single fire.
#
# blocked: scripted slot-change subscribe + body dispatch require T69 globals exposure
# matrix-row: reactive-slot-change
#
# Reason:
#   Object.new() and slot-change event subscription via at (obj.x.changed?)
#   require T69 globals exposure + stdlib.  The OP_GETSLOT_CHANGED fast-path
#   probe (test_op_getslot_change_event.c) and urbi_emit_slot_change_if_subscribed
#   chain walk (test_slot_change_callsites.c) are tested at the C level.
#   The subscriber body dispatch requires scratch-frame execution.
#
# Activate when Object.new() + slot-change scripted subscribe + body dispatch wired.
#
# Urbiscript source (activate at T69 + M5-scratch-frame):
#   var obj = Object.new();
#   var fired = 0;
#   at (obj.x.changed?) Realm.fired = Realm.fired + 1;
#   obj.x = 42;
#   fired
#   --- expected output ---
#   [00000000] nil
#   [00000001] 0
#   [00000002] nil
#   [00000003] 42
#   [00000004] 1
